  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Myriad Year Flying Warship, Fang Yuan pairs Myriad Beings Assimilation Transformation with this killer move. Fairy Zi Wei feels like she sits on a wild horse carriage that cannot stop; starlight specks fade away, and backlash leaves her near death and unconscious.",
