    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan holds Ye Lui Qun Xing’s leading countless stars among loot from earlier, together with Dong Fang Chang Fan’s Myriad Star Fireflies. The move uses star fragments as its primary resource and spends little immortal essence; star fragment attraction generates starlight magnetic force that keeps manipulating stars, and the move grows stronger as more stars gather. In the Northern Plains battle, Ye Lui Qun Xing used it and was virtually unstoppable. The move targets stars and makes use of them; with star path and formation path grandmaster attainment plus the light of wisdom, Fang Yuan modifies it in battle and destroys Fairy Zi Wei’s transportation formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1938
      ],
